This Terraform configuration creates an AWS Lightsail instance and attaches multiple persistent Lightsail disks to it. It defines the AWS provider, default variables for the region, instance settings, and a map of disks to create and attach. Each disk is created in the same Availability Zone as the instance and attached using a unique disk path.

